      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kake%2C_Alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "American maritime fur traders visited Kake in the early 1800s, with ships like the Atahualpa in 1805 and the Otter in 1811.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
